# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
# q90b (7.4 base, next-20261020): config decisions of the 7.4 config pass, on top of q89z's config + distro-neutral.
# Each line keeps q89z's behaviour where a new upstream default would change it without a gain for the Pad 4.
# Another SoC's pin controller and GCC, new defaults =y (built in, never match on SM8850): off
# CONFIG_PINCTRL_MSM8952 is not set
# CONFIG_MSM_GCC_8952 is not set
# NXP i.MX8QM erratum workaround, new default y: not this SoC
# CONFIG_NXP_IMX8QM_ERRATUM_ERR050104 is not set
# Arm CCA realm guest (RSI SMC probe at boot), new default y: the Pad 4 never runs as a realm
# CONFIG_ARM_RMM_RSI is not set
# CHECK_WX replaces DEBUG_WX (off in q89z) and now defaults to y: keep the boot-time W+X walk off as before
# CONFIG_CHECK_WX is not set
